        "jsCode": "const inquiryDate = DateTime.fromISO($json.inquiryDate);\nconst now = DateTime.now();\nconst daysPassed = now.diff(inquiryDate, 'days').days;\n\nlet urgencyTier;\nif (daysPassed <= 1) {\n  urgencyTier = \"Fresh\";\n} else if (daysPassed <= 3) {\n  urgencyTier = \"Follow Up Soon\";\n} else {\n  urgencyTier = \"Urgent - Lead Going Cold\";\n}\n\nconst dohaNow = DateTime.now().setZone('Asia/Qatar');\nconst currentHour = dohaNow.hour;\nconst isBusinessHours = currentHour >= 9 && currentHour < 18;\n\nreturn {\n  json: {\n    inquiryDate: $json.inquiryDate,\n    daysPassed: daysPassed,\n    urgencyTier: urgencyTier,\n    currentHourDoha: currentHour,\n    isBusinessHours: isBusinessHours\n  }\n};"
